      "title": {
        "en": "Imieniny w kalendarzu"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Polish calendars print the names that celebrate each day, so *w kalendarzu* you can see whose name day it is today. You have a name day *raz w roku*, once a year. At work people *raczej* (rather) celebrate name days, and at home birthdays, though every family has its own way. More dates: *jedenastego*, *czternastego*, *piętnastego*, and at the end of a month *trzydziestego pierwszego*."
      }
    }
  ],
